e is stated and the exposure and reserves are disclosed, but no exposure-vs-reserves headroom test is performed - the GBP50m HDL facility exceeds total reserves). Reading the capital strategy IMPROVED four requirements: CS-01 (2->3), CS-02 (2->3), CS-05 (2->3) and PI-08 (0->1), and firmed the evidence for CS-03, COM-01/02/03/04/06/07/09, GOV-06, KS-03 and RISK-05. Other gaps: no sterling-only borrowing statement (BOR-03), no derivatives policy (RISK-06), PI-08 income-dependence ratio still not presented as an indicator. Not applicable: CS-06 (treasury not delegated), COM-11 (holds material non-treasury investments), MRP-04 (England).","gaps":[{"id":"PI-08","evidence":"Cap Strat p.14 sec 9.4-9.6 commercial/service income streams supporting the general fund (EFS rent GBP1.7m 2026/27; HDL loan interest; HLL loan interest); TMSS p.18 Tables 10/11 forecast income Capital Loans GBP324k + Working Capital Loans GBP581k"},{"id":"PI-12","evidence":"TMSS p.16 Table 8 investment fixed/variable rate exposure limits (100%/75%)"},{"id":"LB-01","evidence":""},{"id":"LB-02","evidence":""},{"id":"LB-03","evidence":""},{"id":"LB-04","evidence":""}],"documents":[{"title":"Treasury Management Strategy Statement 2026/27 and Prudential Indicators 2025/26-2028/29 (Appendix 1)","url":"https://hertsmere.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s71513/App1-Treasury Management Strategy 2026-27.pdf","fy":"2026/27","role":"Primary document. Source for the prudential/treasury indicators, MRP policy statement, annual investment strategy, borrowing strategy, reporting cycle, governance/scheme of delegation, risk and ESG scores (PI-01..12, LB, INV, BOR, MRP, RPT, GOV, RISK, KS, TMP, ESG)."},{"title":"Capital Strategy 2026 (Appendix B to CAB/26/85, Cabinet 11 Feb 2026)","url":"https://hertsmere.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s71242/20260211CAB-CAB2685-AppB-Capital Strategy 2026.pdf","fy":"2026/27","role":"Standalone capital strategy. Source for the capital-strategy and commercial/proportionality disclosures (CS-01/02/03